# Nmap Labs

## Overview

Welcome to my **Nmap Labs** repository.

This repository documents my hands-on practice with **Nmap (Network Mapper)** while studying cybersecurity. The goal is to understand how network scanning works, identify open ports and services, and become familiar with basic reconnaissance techniques in a safe virtual lab environment.

> **Disclaimer:** All scans in this repository were performed only on my own virtual machines and authorized lab environments for educational purposes.

